        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "block-1395",
        "sourceIds": ["block-1395"],
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Aulamus offers an additional stat line, in this case we used Might"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "list-block-1396",
        "sourceIds": [],
        "kind": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          [
            {
              "id": "block-1396",
              "sourceIds": ["block-1396"],
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Attack Increase 2.9% (29 Might stat line) = 1.87% more damage for Aulamus"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "block-1398",
        "sourceIds": ["block-1398"],
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "ㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡ"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "block-1400",
        "sourceIds": ["block-1400"],
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "When comparing only the attack and damage boost difference, Kromede deals 4.53% more damage"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "block-1402",
        "sourceIds": ["block-1402"],
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "When comparing only the attack increase from Might (2.9%), Aulamus deals 1.87% more damage"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "block-1404",
        "sourceIds": ["block-1404"],
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "When factoring only the attack difference, damage boost difference, and attack increase (extra stat line being Might) difference, Kromede deals 2.61% more damage than Aulamus",
            "strong": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "block-1406",
        "sourceIds": ["block-1406"],
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "AMP 3 Kromede vs Amp 3 Aulamus (extra line being Might for Aulamus), Kromede is better by less than 1%",
            "strong": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "block-1408",
        "sourceIds": ["block-1408"],
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Note: Kromede wins by less the stronger the character",
            "emphasis": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "block-1410",
        "sourceIds": ["block-1410"],
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "ㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡ"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "block-1412",
        "sourceIds": ["block-1412"],
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "If Aulamus has either a Damage Boost (2.8%), Weapon Damage Boost (4%), Combat Speed, or Multi-hit (needs more testing but likely as well) line advantage while maintaining its Might Advantage, then Aulamus is better. In other words, if Aulamus has a 2 line advantage it’s better."
          }
        ]
