          {
            "text": "Note:",
            "strong": true,
            "highlight": "#f8f9fa"
          },
          {
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "text": "You can now transfer Aulamus and Kromede into the crafted version of the same ILVL as of the 10/28 update. True Dragon (Tier 1 crafted) can be upgraded to Amp 3 now, White Dragon (Tier 2 crafted) can be upgraded to Amp 5 now. Aulamus remains the same with Amp 3 being max.",
            "highlight": "#f8f9fa"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "block-1432",
        "sourceIds": ["block-1432"],
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Note 2:",
            "strong": true,
            "highlight": "#f8f9fa"
          },
          {
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "text": "It is very expensive to reroll lines and push from Amp 3 to Amp 5. Remember, Kromede offers 3 stat lines vs Aulamus offering 4 stat lines, vs Crafted offering 5 stat lines at base.",
            "highlight": "#f8f9fa"
          }
        ]
